🇺🇸🇷🇺🇺🇦NEW VIDEO: Strike on Crimean Bridge Ups Costs for Russia, Encourages Ukraine to Continue Self-Destructive War

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/EhrX-5xX9EM?si=7iPy_e9wPcbaxji3

▪️The US has attempted to destroy the Crimean Bridge since provoking the 2022 proxy war with Russia in Ukraine in the first place; 

▪️Previous strikes have disrupted/damaged the bridge; 

▪️Crimea rejoined Russia in 2014 and existed without a bridge until 2018, and without a land bridge until 2022, and will continue to benefit from the land bridge as well as sea and air logistics despite the bridge’s collapse; 

▪️Collapsing the bridge is part of a wider strategy of “extending Russia,” aimed at raising the costs for Russia across a wide variety of fronts - military, economic, and political; 

▪️The strikes also help encourage Ukraine to fight on in an otherwise self-destructive war US policymakers knew would destroy Ukraine before even starting it - as well as helping sell continued investment of Western tax dollars into the Ukraine proxy war;
